| Everyone else | ~170 | ~8% |

"Everyone else" includes Ollie Buck, Eric di Domenico, Alberto Leal, max.laverse, dependabot[bot] and Saad Tazi.

- **Two authors hold about 73% of the code.** No one else has more than about 5%.
- **Test files are most of the line count.** `test/test.js` alone is about 1,370 lines of the reformat diff. The split would look different if you counted only `lib/`.
- **The `-w` flag could have pushed lines to the wrong person.** I skipped only the reformat commit, so the earlier `b2005d9` ("annotate handlers") still counts. Any other formatting-only commit would still count for its author.
- **Blame cannot tell a rewrite from an original.** A line goes to whoever last touched it, not to whoever first wrote the idea. If you want ownership by file or directory, I can break it down that way.

