The most recent commit (`62628c0`, "reformat js with 4-space indent and double quotes", by Fiona Formatter) rewrote about 1,000 lines in `lib/` and `test/`. Plain blame credits Fiona with 291 lines, which isn't real authorship. I excluded that commit with `--ignore-rev`. I also ignored whitespace (`-w`) and followed moved or copied lines (`-M -C`). That gives each line to the person who last changed its substance.

| Author | Lines | Share |
|---|---|---|
