## 🚌 Bus Factor Analysis
Period: all history | Generated: 2026-10-24 | Method: `git blame -w -M -C` on HEAD, ignoring the reformat commit `62628c0`

### Project-level bus factor: 1

> Troy Goode owns 56.2% of the lines that exist today. If they left, more than half the codebase would have no knowledgeable maintainer.

The repo has 7 source files and 1,202 surviving lines. Ownership by those lines:

| Author | Surviving lines | Share |
|---|---|---|
| Troy Goode | 676 | 56.2% |
| Douglas Christopher Wilson | 394 | 32.8% |
| Alejandro Caravaca Puchades | 30 | 2.5% |
| Eric di Domenico | 16 | 1.3% |
| Alberto Leal | 15 | 1.2% |
| ~15 others | 71 combined | about 6% |

Troy and Wilson together own about 89%. Everyone else is a minor contributor.

**Commit counts mislead here.** Wilson has more commits (143 vs 120), but Troy has about 70% more surviving code. Commit counts would have named the wrong primary owner. The reformat commit would also have made a plain blame credit most lines to "Fiona Formatter", so I excluded it.

### Per-file ownership

| File | Top owner | Share | Second | Dependents | Risk |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| `lib/index.js` | Troy Goode | 159 of about 220 lines (~72%) | Wilson, 22 lines | All tests import it, and it is the only runtime source file | **HIGH** |
| `test/test.js` | Wilson (339) and Troy (317) | about 40% each | Caravaca Puchades, 18 | None (a leaf) | LOW (shared) |
| `test/example-app.js` | Troy | 67 of 81 lines (83%) | Wilson | None | LOW |
| `test/error-response.js` | Troy | 57 of 66 lines (86%) | Wilson | None | LOW |
| `test/issue-2.js` | Troy | 40 of 48 lines (83%) | Wilson | None | LOW |
| `test/vary.js` | Troy | 100% | none | None | LOW (single owner, but a small, recent test) |
| `test/support/env.js` | Wilson | 100% | none | None | LOW (2 lines) |

I did not count dependents rigorously. The shell glob failed in my dependents grep. The "all tests import it" claim comes from the repo layout, not from that grep.

### Is the owner still around?

- Troy's last commit was 2026-04-10, about 6.5 months ago.
- No one has committed in the last 90 days, so the project looks dormant.
- The last non-bot commits were Vansh Sharma (2026-04-07) and Ulises Gascón (2026-01-22). Neither owns meaningful surviving code.
- Wilson's last commit is further back. I only checked recent authors, not his exact date.

